# Build context is the monorepo root (apps/web/Dockerfile). Docker reads the
# .dockerignore from the context root, so this is the one that applies — the
# apps/web/.dockerignore is NOT consulted for root-context builds.
# Keep node_modules out of `COPY . .` so the installed trees from the deps stage
# (root + per-workspace node_modules) are not overwritten by an empty/foreign copy.
**/node_modules
**/.next
.git
**/.env*.local
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.bootspring
